      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for your policy memo.\n\n**Subject: Guiding Principles for Political and Social Expression in the Workplace**\n\nThis policy aims to support the right of all employees to hold and express personal political views, provided that such expression is not the focus of the work or the direct target of strong disruption. We are committed to maintaining a professional, respectful, and inclusive environment for all team members, free from bias and harassment. Therefore, political advocacy should generally take place outside of core work time and in a way that supports a positive, professional culture for everyone.",
